{"ref":"BDB, שָׂמֵחַ","hw":"שָׂמֵחַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂמֵחַ</span></big>  <strong>adj.verb. glad, joyful, merry</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.15\">Dt 16:15</a> +, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמֵחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:9\" href=\"/Psalms.119.9\">ψ 119:9</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמֵחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.45\">1 K 1:45</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.17\">Is 24:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמֵחֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:26\" href=\"/Psalms.35.26\">ψ 35:26</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  as adj. <em>joyful, shewing joy</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.45\">1 K 1:45</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:9\" href=\"/Esther.5.9\">Est 5:9</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹב לֵב</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Esther 5:14\" href=\"/Esther.5.14\">14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵם שְׂמֵחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:9\" href=\"/Psalms.113.9\">ψ 113:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.13\">Pr 15:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.22\">17:22</a>; at feast of tab. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.15\">Dt 16:15</a>, in thankfulness to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 126:3\" href=\"/Psalms.126.3\">ψ 126:3</a> (both pred. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָיָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:66\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.66\">1 K 8:66</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹבֵי לֵב</span>) = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 7:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.7.10\">2 Ch 7:10</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  = pt. <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:40\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.40\">1 K 1:40</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחַלְּלִים</span> <em>piping</em>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.20\">4:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.14\">2 K 11:14</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">תֹּקֵעַ ב</span>) = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.13\">2 Ch 23:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> rei <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.10\">Ec 2:10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  as subst. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:13\" href=\"/Amos.6.13\">Am 6:13</a> (+ ל rei), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 2:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.2.14\">Pr 2:14</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> inf.), <a data-ref=\"Job 3:22\" href=\"/Job.3.22\">Jb 3:22</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלֵי־גִיל</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשִׂישׂוּ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְחֵי־לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.7\">Is 24:7</a>; of malicious joy <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.5\">Pr 17:5</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> rei), <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמֵחֵי רָעָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:26\" href=\"/Psalms.35.26\">ψ 35:26</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׂמְחָה","prev":"BDB, שָׂמַח"}